    "body": "References #1552 and #820.\n\nA source-wide cue bonus cannot change token order within a retrieved record. This adds a learned native signed-H4 relation between each Source prefix before its candidate and the actual emitted response prefix. Offline Rust learns960 Q4 coefficients with context, Copy/terminal heads and cue48 frozen; generation loads the packed native carrier. All Source occurrences and global Copy/Period/Stop aliases remain available, with no cursor or gold-source gate. A source-prefix-unary arm retains the same input access/capacity and measured cost; effective visited support differs.\n\nThe paired64-update fit selects directed64: full128 native CE1.040055→0.277161; single-source replies34→59/64; bank replies2→30/64; fresh0→8/32, including one complete query pair. Unary selects unchanged0. Fresh correct actual first tokens8→23 and capped loops11→1. General prose/reasoning/chat, full-history retrieval, universal geometric advantage and laptop energy are not established; no shared-session default is promoted.\n\nValidation: two native tests, one focused training test, two driver tests, release and formatting passed. The report-cap-only successor reran the driver tests and release. Actual full128/1204 zero parity, raw F32/Q4 and native alias arithmetic, frozen-parent and own-prefix reviews passed; all returned files have exactSHA/file-set verification. Saved-file audits do not independently execute backward/native/BPE. Scientific fit sourcef7076aa4 and executablec075c6f1 are recorded separately from documentation commits. Earlier test-conversion/debugdisk failures and every candidate are retained. Queue statuses are compatibility acknowledgements, not executed tests.\n\nIndependent failure diagnosis finds18/24 fresh failures at terminal phases. The roadmap next coadapts existing nativePeriod/Stop with prefix64/cue48/context/Copy frozen and honest artifact rebinding. A source-end geometric carrier is the constructive fallback if those observations are insufficient. CPU-only existing Runpod48, modelreports54.299/52.050s; complete card/resources and verified /workspace archival are recorded in the evidence.\n",
